*.log
_oqs/

# Key material: never commit private keys, even throwaway demo ones.
#
# Deliberately NOT ignoring *.pem / *.der / *.crl repo-wide. This file applies
# to the whole repository, and those globs would silently swallow another
# module's certificate test fixtures -- git add would appear to do nothing,
# with no error to explain why. The demo writes to a temp directory outside
# the repo by default; keys/ catches it if pointed inside. The two globs
# below only match obvious private-key filenames.
keys/
*.key
*private*.pem
